                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>5</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16661704" author="klaster_1" created="Wed, 24 Oct 2018 04:12:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt; I&apos;ve implemented all the frontend parts, but a portion of backend needs some changes too: when admin creates a user, backend should not switch session to the new user.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16661710" author="klaster_1" created="Wed, 24 Oct 2018 04:20:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt; what to test:&lt;br/&gt;
 1. Signup page should behave exactly as before.&lt;br/&gt;
 2. Email validation on signup page should work.&lt;br/&gt;
 3. Admin page should have &quot;Add user&quot; action.&lt;br/&gt;
 4. &quot;Create user&quot; dialog should create user.&lt;br/&gt;
 5. Admin doesn&apos;t get logged out after creating a user.&lt;br/&gt;
 6. New user is inserted into users list after successful user creation.&lt;br/&gt;
 7. All fields on signup/user creation forms have validation.&lt;br/&gt;
 8. Password, phone, checkbox input validation did not break in other places.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;9.&#160;If account was created by admin, user should get e-mail about this.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;10. Set &quot;disableSelfRegistration&quot; flag to true and check that &quot;Sign up&quot;&#160;will&#160;not happen.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16661860" author="klaster_1" created="Wed, 24 Oct 2018 07:27:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;As a part of the task email, password, checkbox and phone inputs were updated to use &lt;em&gt;$input&lt;/em&gt; validation approach instead of legacy &lt;em&gt;${form}&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;${name}&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16663126" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 25 Oct 2018 02:54:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=anovikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;anovikov&quot;&gt;anovikov&lt;/a&gt;, Please review my changes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;PR:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5072&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5072&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16666714" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 03:56:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please test with docker.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To disable signup just pass this option to &quot;docker run&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;docker run -e &quot;server_disable_signup=true&quot; --rm -it -p 9090:80&#160;$IMAGE_ID&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16666741" author="pkonstantinov" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 04:14:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Works right with &quot;server_disable_signup=true&quot;, but doesn&apos;t work in case if &quot;server_disable_signup=false&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16666823" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 07:26:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed. Please retest following scenarios:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;No&#160;&quot;server_disable_signup&quot; - not specified at all.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;server_disable_signup=true&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;server_disable_signup=false&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16666883" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 09:11:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt;, Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Artem+Budnikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Artem Budnikov&quot;&gt;Artem Budnikov&lt;/a&gt;, We need to describe how to disable self-registration on Web Console in Ignite Web Console docs.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16666921" author="artem budnikov" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 09:43:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt; please create a separate documentation ticket for this functionality.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16666927" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 09:47:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user akuznetsov-gridgain closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5072&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5072&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16679290" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 8 Nov 2018 04:31:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Re-tested on the master branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
